D[7810]={d="There must be more to being a master of the arena than this!   Perhaps the Pirate who runs the event at Gurubashi will know!",o="Speak with Short John Mithril in the Stranglethorn Arena.",s=18706,t="PvP"}
D[7811]={r="i14047x60"}
D[7812]={r="i14047x20"}
D[7813]={d="As with most other fabrics, our stocks of wool are at an all-time low. Our stores are such that we'd only need sixty pieces of wool from you total; we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.$B$BA benevolent gift such as wool, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",r="i2592x60"}
D[7814]={r="i4306x60"}
D[7815]={d="Don't let their big eyes fool you, mon! Those saltwater snapjaws be a menace. I can't fish for five minutes without getting a broken line from one of those oversized fish vacuums stealing my bait.$B$BDo me and the people of Revantusk Village a service and kill em, mon.$B$BKill the whole lot of em!",f=8,m=7500,o="Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 15 Saltwater Snapjaw turtles. Return to him when you have completed this task.",r="m2505x15",w="19022x1"}
D[7816]={d="Yo! There be a turtle out there not like the others. She be the Gammerita, leader of the saltwater snapjaws - a downright dirty thievin' reptile.$B$BMon, she stole my best lure. Snapped it right off my line! Since then, the fish just aren't biting the same.$B$BFind Gammerita and get my lure out of her stomach.",f=8,m=14000,o="Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill Gammerita and retrieve Katoom's Best Lure from her corpse.$B$BKatoom mentioned that Gammerita hangs out on the coast with the other turtles.",r="i19023x1",t="Elite"}
