D[8001]={d="I am Corpus and you are a wretched speciman, YES! You will do nicely, It has become overcrowded in this town and it is getting harder to find a empty grave. Can you help me get rid of some of the filthy zombies investing my graves, 5 should be enough to guarantee me a resting space.",o="Kill 5 Wretched Zombies",r="i19213x1",t="PvP"}
