D[8687]={d="Reinforcements have been called on to join the assault on Hive'Zora.  You have been selected to target Hive'Zora tunnelers.  Report back to Commander Mar'alith after completing your task.",f=256,o="Slay 30 Hive'Zora Tunnelers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Combat Task Briefing VII in order to complete this quest.\13\n",r="m11726x30;i21251x1",s=21251,t="Elite",w="20802x1"}
