D[8689]={d="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.",f=8,o="Bring 1 Qiraji Martial Drape, 2 Jasper Idols, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus.  You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",r="i20885x1;i20870x2;i20859x5;i20863x5",t="Raid",w="21412x1"}
