D[9111]={c="22512x1",d="<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>$B$BBlessed $Gboy:girl, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.$B$BBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",f=64,o="Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Robe of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",r="i22351x1;i22376x25;i14342x4;i20725x2",t="Raid"}
